[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0010","text":"羽那酱\n我可以去看看零食吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0020","text":"零食？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0030","text":"嗯，我想带点什么\n作为下次演唱会的慰问品"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0040","text":"难得是全事务所聚在一起的机会\n想让大家一起吃……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0050","text":"而且……如果能成为大家聊天的契机\n我会很开心的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0060","text":"啊——，确实──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0070","text":"那个，我也一起去买可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0080","text":"当然可以～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0090","text":"去找能让大家都开心的\n好吃的零食吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0100","text":"嗯——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0110","text":"……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0120","text":"（…………刚才那个感觉\n　再来一次──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0130","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0140","text":"纠结了好久……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0150","text":"买到了呢～\n有自信的慰问品……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0160","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0170","text":"大家一定会\n很开心的吧──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0180","text":"接下来，就只要我们在\n演唱会正式演出上加油了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0190","text":"是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0200","text":"——啊，对了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0210","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0220","text":"『演唱会，一起加油吧』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0230","text":"哇，羽那酱……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0240","text":"『与其说一起加油』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0250","text":"『我会加油的！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0260","text":"『这样？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0270","text":"……呵呵～\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0280","text":"『我也会加油的！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0290","text":"啊哈，阳希酱\n谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0300","text":"——啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0310","text":"是制作人发来的──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0320","text":"『哦！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0330","text":"『我也会加油的』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0331","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0340","text":"呵呵──！／呵呵～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0350","text":"现在已读是２了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0360","text":"还有——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0370","text":"嗯……！\n路加酱，现在在做什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0380","text":"我说——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0390","text":"啊，羽那酱\n看屏幕……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0400","text":"啊哈，已读３──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_08_0401","text":"Motion"}]
